cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use tidymarkers in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "tidymarkers: Tidy Design and Quality Control of Genetic Markers"
abstract: >-
  An opinionated, reproducible toolkit for designing and quality controlling
  genetic markers across many chemistries (KASP, CAPS/dCAPS, tetra-primer ARMS,
  HRM, Sanger, SSR, InDel-size, TaqMan/dPCR, SNaPshot, LAMP/RPA, CRISPR-Dx).
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Stathmin/tidymarkers
url: https://github.com/Stathmin/tidymarkers
authors:
